5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of reinventing the wheel. Let’s actually check the archives before we get excited again.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. We shouldn’t guess. Let’s verify the actual capacity before we promise miracles.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with both of you. We need solid data to avoid repeating past mistakes. Let’s focus on the facts.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I smile softly. You are right, dear friends. Let us look closely at the ground beneath our feet before we build.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We need to understand the long-term costs, not just the initial price tag.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
