17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll also review the timed runs and crowd counts. I want to see if the stopwatch matches the complaints.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also review the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I want to know what the ground might hide beneath our plans.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
