35,2,1,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, the late-evening pilot actually hit its cost target. Your “empty crews” fear might be unfounded. Let’s not panic.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, the pilot’s cost target is irrelevant if the roster is empty. The books show the late-turn pool is hollowed out.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@May, the stopwatch confirms my worry. Crowds clear fast, but connections eat the time. We must fix the links, not the platforms.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the ground is indeed hiding voids. Three jobs stalled for weeks. We must price that risk, not ignore it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The ledger shows trimmed subsidies, yet ticketing fees now exceed paving budgets. We are funding the past, not the future.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, the committee minutes reveal a data deadlock. We can’t share passenger info with the ferry. That’s a massive red flag.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, data deadlocks are bureaucratic, but empty rosters are physical. I can’t schedule a ghost. The late-turn pool is simply gone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, I hear your worry, but the data shows the real bottleneck is waiting, not staffing. Let’s fix the connections first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, I understand your fear, but the ground is also treacherous. We must respect both the people and the earth beneath us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I hear you. But if we ignore the recurring fees, we’ll be broke before the first bus even leaves the depot.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Midori, the data deadlock means we can’t even track those connections properly. We’re flying blind. We need a plan that works despite the silence.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, silence is manageable; absence is not. If the late-turn pool is empty, no amount of data fixes a missing driver.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
